        "TileImage": "$($repository 2debbe58-179d-43d1-abd4-5c8430caa8c0).Image",
        "Description": "Much malpractice is occuring in Hokkaido. A head surgeon is taking drugs from the helicopter piliot. Both need to be eliminated. A morgue doctor is doing an illegal experiment on himself while still working. The head of medicine has approoved all of this and thus must be in on it. Eliminate all of these people and you will recieve a sum of 2,000,000 USD. Eliminate All Targets.",
